Prevention of Acts of Violence Against Women

#### Article 46

To anticipate and prevent acts of violence against Women from occurring, the Regional Government shall undertake the following efforts:
a. b. f. providing various proper public facilities for Women in public spaces;

developing an integrated information system database on acts of violence against Women,;

strengthening the competence of apparatus handling violence against Women;

creating various modules and guidelines on the prevention and handling of acts of violence against Women,;

conducting various trainings and guidance for social workers engaged in organizations/institutions handling violence against Women,;

inviting the community to play an active role in recovery and reintegration;

