Provision of Integrated Services for Women Victims of Violence Paragraph Principles and Forms of Services

#### Article 52

Protection of Women victims of violence shall be implemented through the provision of integrated services.

#### Article 53

Integrated services for Women victims of violence as referred to in Article 52 shall be implemented by adhering to principles, which include:
a. gender responsive;

non-discriminatory;

equal and respectful relationships;

maintaining confidentiality;

providing a sense of security and comfort;
31- respecting individual differences;
f. non-judgmental;

respecting the choices and decisions of victims;

sensitive to the background and condition of victims and
i. use of language that is appropriate and understood by victims;

fast and simple;
k. empathy; and fulfillment of Women's rights. 1.

#### Article 54

Forms of integrated services for Women victims of violence shall be provided in the form of:
a. complaint handling;

health rehabilitation;

social rehabilitation;

law enforcement and legal assistance; and repatriation and social reintegration.

